      "message": "mBluetoothGatt would be set to null without clearBleApps() if GATT service disconnect unexpectedly, in order to make sure Bluetooth stay at BLE_ON after restart. However, if there\u0027s a Bluetooth state change message (TURNING_OFF -\u003e BLE_ON) after the service disconnect message, sendBrEdrDownCallback() in bluetoothStateChangeHandler() would be called and hit this NPE issue.\nAnd since it was TURNING_OFF -\u003e BLE_ON, we should make sure Bluetooth get ON state instead of BLE_ON after restart.",
